      "mathematical_entry": "Study rigorous downstream conditional consequences with explicit conductor and quotient-index dependence: smooth dyadic prime sums in each coset of an abelian unit quotient; bound the number of empty cosets by character orthogonality and Parseval, and sharpen the power in the single quadratic nonresidue application to 8.",
